Z||000000||Sillhouette.com||06-03-2000||05:33 PM||||I got a bunch of pictures of my done up Fiero and need help on how to post it.  The pictures reside on my hard drive and not on my website. I don't know if that was relevant<BR>Any help is appreciated. Thanks in advance.<P>Cheers||||reg||5
Z||000001||SCCA FIERO||06-03-2000||05:43 PM||||There is a program that you can download to post pics from your computer to this Forum. It is called PIP(Pennock's Image Poster) and the link to it is at the bottom of this page. After you d/l it,post a response (or new topic) then click start, then programs, then click on PIP. After you browse through your HD using PIP push "post it". Then it will upload and you can close PIP. Now click on the part of the reply(or new thread)where you would be typing and posting the picture and push "crtl and V" at the same time. That's it.||||reg||1
Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||06-03-2000||05:43 PM||||If you have Windows, you can download PIP (linked at the bottom of the page)<P>it's a great little utility for uploading photos to the forum||||reg||1
